    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jopendo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dhiri cwo bedo jopendo i piny ma Kanan, m'akidho miyo Joisiraili; wok kwoŋ kisi nono pajo, ibino dhiro jacwo, kisi jatel i dier jo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Musa to dhiro jo wok i thim ma Paran, cungo kwoŋ or pa Rwoth, joje cwo ma jotel i dier Joisiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a nyingi jo: Wok i nono pa Ruben, Samuwa wod pa Zakur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Simeo, Safat wod pa Hor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Yuda, Kaleb wod pa Yefune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Isakar, Igal wod pa Yozefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Efrayim, Hoseya wod pa Nun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Benyamin, Palti wod pa Rafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Zebulun, Gadel wod pa Sodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Yozefu meno nono pa Manase, Gad wod pa Sus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Dan, Amiel wod pa Gemal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Aser, Sethur wod pa Mikaili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Nafital, Nabi wod pa Vofisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Gad, Guwel wod pa Maki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a nyingi cwo ma Musa ooro bedo jopendo ma lowo. Musa to wiro nyingi Hoseya wod pa Nun ni Yosuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Musa ooro jo bedo jopendo i piny ma Kanan, owaco rijo ni, “Kadhi win koro yupiny, aka wikidhi i piny matendere tendere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "winen paka lowo cale, kodi kinen ji ma jobed'iye jotek kosa jonyap, k'inen jonok kosa jomore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni win ka lowo ma jobed'iye ber kosa rac, kodi kinen tindin ma jobed'iye k'ogoy cel iye kosa ogoy cel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi k'inen lowo ago oŋaŋ kosa ma candi, kodi kinen yen niye kosa ongoye. Bedi win jomiseni, aka wikel olemo moro ma lowo.” Onyo oyido obedo hongo marapena mar'olemo m'ocek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno jokidho malo timo nyaliŋliŋ i lowo wok i thim ma Zin tundo Rehob, cegin gi Lebohamath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokadho yupiny, to jotundo Hebron; aka Ahiman, Sesay, kodi Talmay, Joanakim, oyido jonitie kenyo. (Ogeti Hebron oro abirio mafodi k'ogeti Zowan i Misir.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotundo i malawa ma Esikol, to jotoŋo wok kenyo jangi yath manitie gi kayego acel mar'olemo, to jotiŋo i gute i dier jo jario. Jodwoko bende gi pomo kodi nyandere moro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwoŋi kenyo ni Malawa Esikol",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dwoŋ Esikol gi Dhohiburu obedo Kayego olemo",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwoŋbedo lwak Joisiraili joŋado piny wok kenyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Radwok pa jonyaliŋliŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ndelo piero aŋwen otieko rumo, jopendo jodok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino bongi Musa kodi Aron kodi kweth je pa Joisiraili i thim ma Paran, i Kades; jodwoko rijo wac kodi kweth je, to jonyutho jo olemo ma lowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jowaco rigo ni, “Watundo i lowo m'idhir'iye wan; cak gi mo kic mol'iye, aka me olemo mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kad'ameno ji ma jobedo i lowo jotek, aka tindin ogoy'iye cel aka jolac swa; medo kwoŋ meno, waneno nyikway Anak kanyago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joamalek jobedo i lowo ma yupiny; Johiti, Joyebus, kodi Joamor jobedo yupiny matendere; aka Jokanan jobedo yuthengi nam, kodi yuthengi Yordan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Kaleb omiyo ji liŋ ruwaŋ Musa, to waco ni, “Weyi wakadhi win dicel wabed'iye, kole wanyalo mako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to cwo m'oyido jokadho gine jowaco ni, “Wakinyali kidho malo lweny gi ji me, kole jotek loyo wan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
